  "notes": [
    "v2 after review.7AW6HSPWJX400K91AE2JKQZ94R (changes_requested on two missing test groups).",
    "Coordinator added: the five join refusal branches (already joined, stale application revision, empty reason, foreign objective, the 100-task ceiling) each proving the ledger is untouched; the tracker DTO provenance test (created task reports its objective and application, joined task inherits the application objective, unrelated task reports null for both); the apply partial-write/replay test proving one application, not two.",
    "DEFECT FOUND AND FIXED by the coordinator while writing the DTO test: src/agent_commons/ui/tracker_reads.py validated application ids with is_typed_id, which requires a 26-character ULID suffix, while an application id is 'application.' plus a 64-character digest (ADR 0021, and the pattern the blueprint-application schema itself declares). Every application id therefore failed the check, so the tracker DTO never reported application_id and never inherited the application objective; the domain and the projection were correct. The read now matches the schema pattern and the three cases are pinned.",
    "Runs 1-3 ended needs_operator with checkpoints; run 4 succeeded. Earlier coordinator additions: the golden replay test and the join route refusal test; the frozen panel identity pin updated for the fixed task:join_application capability, with the one-time transition disclosed (a panel session opened by an older binary no longer deduplicates).",
    "Extra paths claimed after the runs: src/agent_commons/ui/session_owner.py, tests/ui/conftest.py, tests/ui/test_session_owner.py, tests/ui/test_task_join_route.py."
